GMTe


00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:29.580
GMTea


00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:29.840
GMTeam


00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.100
GMTeam m


00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:30.360
GMTeam mo


00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:30.620
GMTeam mov


00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:30.880
GMTeam movi


